# Evidence policy

- Model confidence is never evidence.
- Accepted classes: FILE, HASH, TEST_RESULT, LOG, MANIFEST, CHECKPOINT, COMMAND_OUTPUT, SCHEMA.
- Claims must point at durable artifacts under the project or `.cursor-loop/`.
- Quarantine malformed derived outputs; do not silently rewrite history.
